    "window_is_the_only_variable": "the three v22 groups differ only in the window K; renderer, contract, four strict track conditions, 160 character bound, registry, read shape, arms, repeats, request cap and trigger gate threshold are identical, and no K may be changed after any saving number has been seen",
    "rule": "the frozen v12 exact duplicate rule runs first; the v5 lineage evidence-safe selective retention then runs on the deduplicated list, with its registered-literal guard, its recovery-pointer requirement and its whole-payload fallback unchanged; the literal-carrier line elision then runs on that result, keeping verbatim every line that contains a registered literal or constraint phrase together with a fixed window of 1 lines before and after it, eliding every other line and replacing each maximal contiguous omitted run with exactly one note line of the form [elided n lines first-last]; the most recent tool group is kept verbatim. Any registered-literal occurrence loss, any non-reduction after the note overhead, or any exception sends the payload this stage received verbatim and is counted in v21_literal_guard_fallbacks",
    "frozen_rule_module": "experiments/runners/openai_agents_exact_duplicate_replay_v12.py",
    "retention_module": "experiments/runners/openai_agents_evidence_safe_retention_v5.py",
