    "chain_blueprint": "experiments/runners/openai_agents_multitask_chain_v14.py",
    "window_frozen": "the window was declared per K in the v22 pre-registration before any paid request; it may not be changed after any saving number is seen, and an unregistered window (for example K=2) may not be run at all",
    "invariant": "for every registered literal and constraint phrase the number of verbatim occurrences after elision is greater than or equal to the number before it, per occurrence and not per distinct string, computed with the same v5 lineage _carrier_loss that already vetoed the older mechanism",
    "fail_closed": "an output is kept verbatim whenever the mechanism cannot prove the invariant for the payload it would send; nothing is removed on the strength of an argument the mechanism cannot check, and the note lines it writes can never satisfy the invariant themselves",
    "trigger_gate": {
      "soft_limit_tokens": 0,
      "policy": "the plugin arm's BudgetTriggeredFilter is installed with soft_limit_tokens=0, which the frozen class floors to 1 (trigger_gate_soft_limit_tokens therefore reports 1), so its condition last_estimated_tokens <= soft_limit_tokens is false for every non-empty payload and the gate fires on every model input after the first; the gate stays in place, keeps measuring each payload and keeps publishing its counters. The setting is inherited from v20 unchanged, so this round measures the window and does not re-measure the gate. Trigger policy stays symmetric_budget so the wrapper is not removed from the plugin arm.",
      "arm_scope": "plugin arm only; the none and native_summary arms are untouched",
      "comparability": "the three v22 groups are comparable to each other as a dose, and each is internally paired; none of them is comparable as a whole configuration to v16, v19, v20 or v21, and none of them may be pooled with another"
